{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "你的职业道路是做真正的制作人  (Your Path Is Becoming a True Producer)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 12 of Behind the Scenes. Riding to the airport before his overseas trip, Chun Yuqiao explains why he took Bu Xiaogu off his personal calendar: her future is becoming a real producer, not an assistant. Back at Xingtian, Xiaogu buries herself in overtime all week until Xingzi checks on her. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杰瑞哥交代过我了，您在美国日程上要是有什么改变随时通知我，我二十四小时开机。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后我日程上的事，你不用管了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的职业道路是做一个真正的制作人，而不是长时间做任何人的助理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你很快会晋升，不要在这些琐事上浪费太多精力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢您。别再对我这么好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你有什么多余的工作要交给我做吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你已经加了一个礼拜班了，今天老大出国，回家休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你跟老大的事呢，怨我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "走，今天晚上带你喝大酒去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，真的。你回去吧，注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天你男朋友不是过生日吗？你把你手头的活都交给我做，早点回家吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，就这样。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杰瑞哥交代过我了，您在美国日程上要是有什么改变随时通知我，我二十四小时开机。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Her manager briefed me — if anything changes in your schedule abroad, notify me anytime; my phone stays on twenty-four hours a day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后我日程上的事，你不用管了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From now on, you don't need to concern yourself with my schedule.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的职业道路是做一个真正的制作人，而不是长时间做任何人的助理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your career path is becoming a true producer, not spending years acting as anyone's assistant.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你很快会晋升，不要在这些琐事上浪费太多精力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will be promoted very soon, so don't waste too much energy on trivial errands like these.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢您。别再对我这么好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you. Please stop being this kind to me...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你有什么多余的工作要交给我做吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, do you have any extra work you can hand over to me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你已经加了一个礼拜班了，今天老大出国，回家休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You've worked overtime for a full week already; our boss flew abroad today, so go home and rest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你跟老大的事呢，怨我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened between you and our boss is my fault.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "走，今天晚上带你喝大酒去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, tonight I'm taking you out for a proper drink!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，真的。你回去吧，注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm fine, really. Head on home and stay safe.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天你男朋友不是过生日吗？你把你手头的活都交给我做，早点回家吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Isn't today your boyfriend's birthday? Hand all your tasks over to me and head home early.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，就这样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't worry about me — off you go.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杰瑞哥交代过我了，您在美国日程上要是有什么改变随时通知我，我二十四小时开机。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后我日程上的事，你不用管了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的职业道路是做一个真正的制作人，而不是长时间做任何人的助理。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你很快会晋升，不要在这些琐事上浪费太多精力。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢您。别再对我这么好了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你有什么多余的工作要交给我做吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你已经加了一个礼拜班了，今天老大出国，回家休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你跟老大的事呢，怨我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "走，今天晚上带你喝大酒去！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，真的。你回去吧，注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天你男朋友不是过生日吗？你把你手头的活都交给我做，早点回家吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，就这样。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Blaming herself for pushing Xiaogu to confess right before Xin Huimei opened Yuqiao's door, Xingzi urges Xiaogu not to bottle up her heartache—though Xiaogu quietly stays behind to keep working. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
